\section{VAMP2}
\label{sec:vamp2}

We concentrate all configuration and run-time data in a derived-type, such that,
[[mci_t]] can spwan each time a distinctive MCI VEGAS integrator object.

<<[[vamp2.f90]]>>=
<<File header>>

module vamp2

<<Use kinds>>
<<Use strings>>
  use io_units
  use format_utils, only: pac_fmt
  use format_utils, only: write_separator, write_indent
  use format_defs, only: FMT_12, FMT_14, FMT_17, FMT_19
  use diagnostics
  use rng_base

  use vegas

<<Standard module head>>

<<vamp2: public>>

<<vamp2: parameters>>

<<vamp2: types>>

